      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hello, thanks for the report.\nI haven't personally heard of this being an issue before, so it's probably somewhat unique. If this happens on one specific avatar, could you please provide the avatar ID that it happens with? If this happens on all the avatars you've tried, could you try one of the public row avatars like brush just to be sure? If it's still happening even on a public avatar, then we'll need more information about what might be unique to your computer, your account, or the way that you use VRChat.",
