  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-27T01:44:04.421Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Not sure where to put this but I'm having a bit of a bug with my favorited avatars. This definitely isn't a priority, it's just a little annoying lol.\nEver since the new update, changing into my avatars has gone like this.\n1. Enter world. Avatar is not moving with my motions but appears to be underneath my head, in which others are able to see but I cannot unless I look down. Avatar does not show in mirrors either. If I try to reset it using the expressions tab on my dial, it doesn't allow me to access the expressions.\n2. Switching into another avatar ends up with me having a working avatar. If I proceed with another switch, my avatar will bug out again.\n3. Each time I switch worlds or my avatars, this problem occurs and is really annoying lol\nLike I said, not a priority, just an annoying issue I'd like the Devs to be aware of!",
